    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Jessie — Log Booking\nWrites a booking's rows to the Jessie Log spreadsheet after the reply has gone. Called by Book Session (v112+) without waiting. A failed write never touches the booking.\n\nv2: a Localization / QC project code not in Airtable Localization Projects -> the New Projects tab (For Review).",
        "width": 420
      },
      "id": "f27b785b-079b-4072-8613-b8280c7bab92",
      "name": "Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1088,
        192
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Project Row (v2): a Localization / QC booking's project code, handed over by Book Session (v115+) - none, no item, nothing\n// looked up or written.\nlet r = null; try { r = JSON.parse(String($('When Executed by Another Workflow').first().json.project || '')); } catch (e) { r = null; }\nconst code = r && typeof r === 'object' ? String(r['Code'] || '').trim().toUpperCase() : '';\nreturn code ? [{ json: Object.assign({}, r, { Code: code }) }] : [];"
      },
      "id": "bbc957ef-2db7-49d9-8e4a-98d23ed921f4",
      "name": "Project Row",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
